## Carnivorous Ink

Carnivorous ink is a black, glossy thing that lies in the dark inside the [[Phenomena/Gloaming Codex|Gloaming Codex]]. It waits flat and still like a spill of ink until something comes near, then reaches out in tendrils to wrap around it and crush. An axe passes straight through one without leaving a mark. Magic can cut one in half, and where it parts it makes two pools that move apart on their own.

## Cursed Thought

A cursed thought is a creature of the dark inside the [[Phenomena/Gloaming Codex|Gloaming Codex]]. What the investigators saw of it was the upper half of a bat-like body, no legs at all, floating above the ground, with cold fire in its hands. It lashes out with claws and with blasts of shadow, and the cold of its touch freezes a limb in place so it cannot be moved. When it is struck down it comes apart into dust.
